From fb322717080443407571d986fcc45d08d0a8f081 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tumredsun <tumredsun@localhost>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 15:20:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/35] clk: sunxi-ng: Add support for Allwinner A733 clock
 control unit

Add DT-binding headers, drivers and enable infrastructure for the
main CCU, the CPU PLL CCU and the PRCM (R) CCU found on the
Allwinner A733 (sun60i-a733) SoC.

The BSP CCU driver is ported to the mainline sunxi-ng framework,
dropping the SDM (spread-spectrum) handling which leaves the SDM
registers at their reset (unmodulated) defaults. Per-clock update-key
support is added to the sunxi-ng core (struct ccu_common gains
key_reg/key_value; gate/mux helpers write the key alongside updates).

The MP_NO_INDEX variant of the BSP MP clock is mapped onto the
existing CCU_FEATURE_DUAL_DIV machinery.
